@startuml RTES_Order_Lifecycle

title Order Lifecycle State Machine

[*] --> PENDING : Client submits order

PENDING --> ACCEPTED : Risk checks pass\nAdded to order book
PENDING --> REJECTED : Risk check fails\n(size/price/credit/rate)

ACCEPTED --> PARTIALLY_FILLED : Partial match\nRemaining qty in book
ACCEPTED --> FILLED : Full match\nOrder complete
ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED : Client cancels\nRemoved from book

PARTIALLY_FILLED --> FILLED : Remaining qty matched
PARTIALLY_FILLED --> CANCELLED : Client cancels\nRemaining qty removed

FILLED --> [*] : Order complete\nReturned to pool
REJECTED --> [*] : Order rejected\nReturned to pool
CANCELLED --> [*] : Order cancelled\nReturned to pool

note right of PENDING
  **PENDING**
  • Order allocated from pool
  • Submitted to Risk Manager
  • Awaiting validation
end note

note right of ACCEPTED
  **ACCEPTED**
  • Risk checks passed
  • Added to order book
  • Resting at limit price
  • Visible in market depth
end note

note right of PARTIALLY_FILLED
  **PARTIALLY_FILLED**
  • Some quantity executed
  • Remaining qty in book
  • Can still be cancelled
  • Multiple trades possible
end note

note right of FILLED
  **FILLED**
  • Fully executed
  • Removed from book
  • Order complete
  • Memory returned to pool
end note

note right of REJECTED
  **REJECTED**
  • Failed risk check
  • Never entered book
  • Reasons:
    - Size limit exceeded
    - Price collar violation
    - Credit limit exceeded
    - Rate limit exceeded
    - Duplicate order ID
    - Invalid symbol
end note

note right of CANCELLED
  **CANCELLED**
  • Client requested cancel
  • Removed from book
  • Remaining qty not filled
  • Memory returned to pool
end note

@enduml
